WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.032
Open the staff time clock. Select the correct employee before reviewing punches. Do not use Clock in to repair an unknown historical event.

00:00:21.032 --> 00:00:31.336
Select the school-local pay period. Confirm the date range used by both the punch table and payroll time cards.

00:00:31.336 --> 00:00:42.724
Compare saved punches with shift evidence. Review clock-in, clock-out, paycode and notes. Correct only verified facts; never invent missing hours.

00:00:42.724 --> 00:00:53.601
Review before saving. Open Payroll time cards to review decimal-hour totals. Printing and sending a summary are separate actions; neither processes payroll.

